  "explanation": "The question asks for the director of the film \"Don't Drink the Water.\" Multiple sources provide conflicting information:\n\n- **Howard Morris** is cited as the director of the 1969 film version in D1S2.\n- **Woody Allen** is cited as the director of the same 1969 film in D3S2, and also as the director of the 1994 TV remake in D4S1.\n- **Stanley Prager** is cited as the director of the 1966 Broadway play in D5S5 and D6S5.\n\nEach of these claims refers to a different version of the work (1969 film, 1994 TV film, and 1966 Broadway play), so they are distinct and valid. Therefore, all three names are accepted as correct within their respective contexts."
